  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "手機阿sáng"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<b id=\"internal-source-marker_0.13457689620554447\" style=\"font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">洪健斌</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"></span><br /><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">看kah一半</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">突然間有手機仔teh kaiⁿ</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">你講kah喙口ê話</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">馬上tiâu--leh</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">一絲歹勢lām躊躇ê神色，隨</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">peh起lih你ê頭面</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">我m̄敢怠慢，趕緊安搭</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">請你接tsit通手機仔</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"></span></b><br />\n<a name='more'></a><b id=\"internal-source-marker_0.13457689620554447\" style=\"font-weight: normal;\">無行出診間<br /><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">你kan-na徛--起-來，koh</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">徙khah邊--a</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">聽ē出來是</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">恁tsa-á囝teh相揣</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">伊beh知tsit-má</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">人tī佗位</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">你ê回答，有淡薄仔趣味：</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">「我to tī hit个. . . ，喔</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Tī街仔--啦，tī街仔teh行路！」</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">診所無beh講</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Hit兩秒ê tùn-teⁿ，好親像</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">你ê頭殼內底有滾ká</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"></span><br /><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">手機仔一講了</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">你就kā我會失禮：</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">「醫師！歹勢--啦！</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">無講tī恁診所，是</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">驚guán tsa-á囝ē煩惱！」</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">有影有夠貼心</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">一時間，我隨感受--著-ah</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">恁tsa-á囝應該</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">koh-khah有所感--pah</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"></span><br /><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">診察煞，送你出--ì</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">看著你liú-lia̍h ê背影</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">我teh想</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">你是一个tuè ē著時代ê</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">七十歲o͘-bá-sáng</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">M̄-nā hām hia-ê慢性病</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">長期tsih接順序</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">連guán tsia-ê少年--ê</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Mā感覺你</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">真好鬥陣</span></b>"
  },
